---
title: Psalm 78:1-7
type: psalm
citation: Psalm 78:1-7
---

<!-- Formatting never crosses a line break: bold each line separately. -->
[Reader] Hear my teaching, O my people; *
incline your ears to the words of my mouth.
[People] **I will open my mouth in a parable;** *
**I will declare the mysteries of ancient times.**
